<h3>usage</h3>
<dl>
  <dt>run on your commandline <%= tag.button :🔗, onclick: "Clippy.copyNextElementSiblingText(this.parentElement)", style: "height: 2em;" %></dt>
  <dd>
    <pre><code>bundle add <%= name %> --source "<%= source_url %>"</code></pre>
  </dd>

  <dt>or, put in your Gemfile <%= tag.button :🔗, onclick: "Clippy.copyNextElementSiblingText(this.parentElement)", style: "height: 2em;" %></dt>
  <dd>
    <pre><code>gem "<%= name %>", source: "<%= source_url %>"</code></pre>
  </dd>
</dl>
